de currently does not work. They patched a fix, then immediately reverted the fix, so I believe they are at least working on it, just no idea on the time frame. There are a couple workarounds that still cause the ultrawide to be pretty jank, in an already pretty jank game. A lot of potential, but I would recommend waiting a bit as Cold Iron Studios hopefully continues to improve the game. Definitely one to keep an eye on if you are tired of killing zombies all the time.", "timestamp_created": 1632341866, "timestamp_updated": 1632341866, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.528301894664764404", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99804967", "author": {"steamid": "76561198035340988", "personaname": "techX", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TechnoBloodbath/", "num_games_owned": 188, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 25828, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9814, "last_played": 1731522871, "avatar": "cc9e44044d00eeeb1d5ae6ec02518c27b4a29625"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best horde game ever", "timestamp_created": 1632341272, "timestamp_updated": 1632341272, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99801407", "author": {"steamid": "76561198027216799", "personaname": "Bifta", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198027216799/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1326, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 749, "last_played": 1643657537, "avatar": "07fbe1424289f89ef7f5dd958d9338338c1f8512"}, "language": "english", "review": "1", "timestamp_created": 1632336040, "timestamp_updated": 1632336040, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99801084", "author": {"steamid": "76561198075295009", "personaname": "JayJay2x4", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DDG_Dennis_Da_Gamer/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 140, "playtime_forever": 406, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 58, "last_played": 1672449159, "avatar": "b6f1b1acc12a56e0829e8c482336c4c3fac9206e"}, "language": "english", "review": "okay the gameplay i will admit and say right now start at Point A travel through to the Sector and Secure the Sector then exit it at Area B very basic stuff but it does pack one hell of a challange with different kinds of Xenos from the Alien Universe but these species doesn't scratch the surface of the Vast specimens of different kind of Xenos in the magnificent H.R Geiger artwork but i gotta say the game is Atmospheric and entertaining and One hell of a bloodrush on extreme difficulty of course like Left 4 Dead Dead Island and other games its one hundred percent more fun to play with Friends. all in all Not bad Would have been better with the gameplay but still its fun", "timestamp_created": 1632335638, "timestamp_updated": 1632335638, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99800752", "author": {"steamid": "76561198245035598", "personaname": "Jeremy Wade", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198245035598/", "num_games_owned": 230, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 5343, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3072, "last_played": 1682792318, "avatar": "464b8eea1dfe82a2a8da8a93f471efdda24a4f68"}, "language": "english", "review": "Nope they disabled mods, this has ruined the game for me and many other players. If they dont revert this change in the coming weeks I think this game will be permanently dead. Buy AvP if you want a good alien game.", "timestamp_created": 1632335146, "timestamp_updated": 1641650173, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99799916", "author": {"steamid": "76561198870555577", "personaname": "Tac Nurse", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/tacnurse/", "num_games_owned": 431, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 4373, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3031, "last_played": 1780898038, "avatar": "368349dcaf60dc5d14c26e79df27932cb482eadd"}, "language": "english", "review": "I have been a huge Aliens fan since I was just a little kid. I have played almost all the games over all the different platforms (emulation for some of the systems I could not afford as a kid). Needless to say I have been pumped for this game to come out since I caught first wind of the Aliens Infiltrator novel being a game tie in. At this time I have 50.5hrs in game... I have to say that I really enjoy it but there are things AS A FAN that I hate. I love the first and last campaigns where it is humans vs xenomorphs. I do get a feeling of fighting an overwhelming force of aliens. I am happy that I preordeed to get the classic uniforms seen in the movie. The weapons and class systems are great. I would have liked to see the real classic M41a pulse rifle in the game with the 99 rounds and grenade launcher but what we get is not so bad. I would have also liked to see the original M240 Incinerator Unit instead of the odd looking flamethrower we get in the game. The game is also missing the classic two pistols from the aliens movie (H&K VP70M and Smith & Wesson Model 39). To make up for that we get a ton of pistols made up for the game. The music... Sucks. No intense drums or military combat type music during dangerous encounters. No creepy sound effects and tones to low orchestra playing. They should have taken notes from the Aliens Vs Predator 2000 Gold Edition OST (I find myself putting it on in the background from youtube while I play and it fits perfectly).  I hate the missions where Prometheus and covenant and slammed down my throat. I hate those movies with a passion and the backstory for xenomorph xx121 is ridiculous at best. The BLACK GOO, Zombies, and combat androids really take me out of the aliens atmosphere. I also hate that 85% of the xenomorphs are runners (aliens breed from four legged animals). The drones (ALIEN) and Warriors (Aliens) are set up to be mid mission bosses.... They cant climb on walls or jump over clutter. They never arrive in an unstoppable force like the runners and busters do. The final mission also does not let you fight the queen... You just run away from her as you cant harm her. No final egg chamber fight. All this can be fixed however with upcoming DLC. As much trash as I have talked, I still recommend this game. As I have said... I am an ALIENS fan and want to see good things happen with this game. I want the player base to stay alive for a long long long time.", "timestamp_created": 1632333981, "timestamp_updated": 1632333981, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99799426", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972478983", "personaname": "skulldude", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197972478983/", "num_games_owned": 497, "num_reviews": 45, "playtime_forever": 1454, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 962, "last_played": 1670609691, "avatar": "d3efe56ffe3faf288de7ac974cba9f55a217af60"}, "language": "english", "review": "I use the heavy flamethrower, it is the best gun, and how I love that gun.\n\n11/10 would ablaze again.", "timestamp_created": 1632333425, "timestamp_updated": 1632333425, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.503617405891418457", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99792547", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057914866", "personaname": "NoahtheBoah36", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/noahtheboah36/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 219, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 139, "last_played": 1632365086, "avatar": "eb7d0641b45b06b892eb3050b3d24df222ea7974"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really annoyed that every time I launch the game I have to re-accept the EULA and do brightness/subtitle settings. If they fix that, the game would be alright.", "timestamp_created": 1632324650, "timestamp_updated": 1632324650, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_a