": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 20982, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2017, "last_played": 1782905644, "avatar": "7ca71aa18308f39d7d87ce048d98300fbc0778b5"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm really enjoying this game and the grinding of weapons/levels although it could do with more missions. \n\nBeing a 3 player squad based PvE game I found I got the most enjoyment when playing with at least one friend, preferably two as the matchmaking isn't working great at the moment.  \n\nLots of nostalgia with references to the Alien movies and the latest Prometheus and Covenant movies.", "timestamp_created": 1632317912, "timestamp_updated": 1632317912, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99786661", "author": {"steamid": "76561197963111369", "personaname": "Azixx", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197963111369/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 10808, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7257, "last_played": 1699782643, "avatar": "7f45101a3ef0a9c61055c9ace6d33212b42dbd2f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Love the franchise. The game is fun and I really enjoyed it...\nBUT\nWithout a quick play / join feature - the current matchmaking is absolutely pathetic for a game like this. This reason alone the game is hemorrhaging players at an fast rate. If this isnt changed soon I fear the game will be dead within a month.\n\nNot worth the current price tag for the state the game is currently in.", "timestamp_created": 1632317134, "timestamp_updated": 1632317134, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.505882382392883301", "comment_count": 0, "