2, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 32, "last_played": 1631827099, "avatar": "9cc33a2f9df6ce442b93922f336060f5960e4895"}, "language": "english", "review": "Look the game is fun and its Aliens  so its a win \n\nthe downside is at the moment  there are allot of bugs that effect the gameplay such as freezing in the middle of missions every 5 seconds   xenomorphs being stuck  that then wont let you progress through a mission  so you have to restart that mission all over again \n\nthere is a very very short campaign with no cut scenes ive finished them and cant figure out a story  of what i just completed \n\nand 1 horde map which you would have thought for an aliens game there would be many more to try  \n\nother than that its a good small game  but lacks potential  in terms of content  to play and story telling \n\ni will say if they want people to pay the asking price allot needs to be done and put into the game down the line for it to be worth full price \n\nits a pity    it doesnt have more to offer  and i hope they listen and add more content to this game along with fixes aswell for bugs \n\nim saying this is a possitive review  as the game is still fun to kill time", "timestamp_created": 1632258748, "timestamp_updated": 1632258748, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525862038135528564", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}]}